WEBVTT

00:00:00.351 --> 00:00:09.871
On the phone, the sliders button at the left of the floating bar opens the project settings: the same list of sections as on the desktop, with the red count on Allowed commands.

00:00:10.823 --> 00:00:20.423
The logo at the top left opens the same left menu as on the desktop: the inbox, Configure agents, and the projects with Project settings, showing what the phone has a view for.

00:00:21.379 --> 00:00:28.459
A section pushes in as its own view, here Allowed commands with the new command to review. Back returns to the list.

00:00:29.413 --> 00:00:42.253
A change the configuration refuses no longer looks saved. Here a main branch the repository does not have: the reason shows under the title, with Try again, and the change stays until it is fixed or reset.

00:00:43.207 --> 00:00:54.367
A change to where agents work still waits for Save and restart agents, now also when the settings are closed and opened again. In short, the settings work the same on the phone, and nothing typed is lost.
